{"id":"la_","lemma":"lá","pos":"adv","rank":54,"glosses":["there (in that place, far from both the speaker and the audience)","used with an adverb phrase to indicate that something is far","used to emphasize a relative distant point in the past or in the future"],"ipa":"/ˈla/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/78/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Juliano_P._Junho_%28Jjunho%29-l%C3%A1.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Juliano_P._Junho_%28Jjunho%29-l%C3%A1.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Você irá lá?","en":"Will you go there?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1269548","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},null]},{"text":"Eu irei lá.","en":"I'll go there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/489874","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},null]},{"text":"Não tem ninguém lá.","en":"No one is there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1270475","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"has / there is","l":"ter"},{"g":"no one"},null]},{"text":"Eu quero trabalhar lá.","en":"I want to work there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/471602","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},{"g":"to work"},null]},{"text":"Queria ir lá.","en":"I wanted to go there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/48274","words":[{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},{"g":"to go"},null]}]}